{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "38778e989cf437951158f00eed4339744e89f236685ea396134a61674a06d105", "ja": "結婚観を、熟考中", "zh": "正在深思结婚观", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "9d9329226a71913af13bab8c0fd5e061640bf7c36a45c005baf2a97434e7db21", "ja": "アンケートの締切が迫る中、回答を進める\n海美、美也、瑞希の3人。あれこれ想像を\n巡らせながら回答している所へ、響と奈緒が\n合流。順調だと思われたが、最後99問目の\n質問で、2人の手が止まってしまう。", "zh": "问卷截止日期临近，继续填写问卷  \n海美、美也和瑞希三位3人。一边天马行空地想象着，  \n正填写到一半时，响和奈绪也加入了进来。原以为进展顺利，  \n可在最后第99道问题中，2人的手却停了下来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7839a22bcc18917b0185d74788d7a364d4c8fd38a1ff36446c378d7eb7b08426", "ja": "（アンケートの〆切が近くなってきた。海美と美也は、\n今日、会議室で一気に片づけるって言ってたけど……）", "zh": "（问卷截止日期快到了。海美和美也说今天要在会议室一口气把它做完来着……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_04_1001_029umi", "source_sha256": "aaa7c51bb8f8ddb3024814e3b387789aa658982c28062a790993a202e06f6ae1", "ja": "『Q.朝食はパン派？　ごはん派？』そっか。一緒に\n暮らすなら、朝ごはんも考えないとだよね……。", "zh": "“Q.早餐是面包派？米饭派？”这样啊。要是\n一起生活的话，确实也得考虑早饭的事呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_04_1002_029umi", "source_sha256": "bb54d1dd1b461f513068486554f0ef43d0bfe62e8dd377ae12ce6b606f8641d9", "ja": "私はプロテインを自分で用意するから、\nどっちでもいいかな！", "zh": "我会自己准备蛋白粉，所以哪种都可以啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_04_1003_042miy", "source_sha256": "23b31619d2ed87bd08edfc37995e72a94cdd62efa7b08d915d3eff3309cd8a7d", "ja": "『Q.戸建てかマンション、希望はある？』\n私は一軒家の方が好きですね～。なので……。", "zh": "“Q.独栋还是公寓，有什么偏好吗？”\n我更喜欢独门独院的房子呢～。所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_04_1004_042miy", "source_sha256": "99a030386bb238e0f1f2069304af2adace564a321da7990b351c9f1ab2766294", "ja": "相手の方がよければ、私の家に一緒に住んで\nもらうのが手っ取り早いかもしれませんな～。", "zh": "如果对方愿意的话，让对方和我一起住在我的家里，或许是最省事的办法呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_04_1005_044miz", "source_sha256": "48cfa006d6227848131fa00a369a3dc17f4a397b75a7973dc2e6fb826af306be", "ja": "『Q.結婚後の苗字、そのまま？　変えたい？』\nなるほど。これは考えたことがありませんでした。", "zh": "“Q.婚后的姓氏，维持原样？还是想改？”\n原来如此。这个我还从来没有考虑过。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_04_1006_044miz", "source_sha256": "c9360890d2a5c76b104b3de3fd65a8452df16db3511be79bcbbef479c51d9532", "ja": "結婚をしたら、そういう変化も起こるんですね。\nもし苗字が変わったら……ごくり。", "zh": "结婚后，还会发生这样的变化啊。\n要是姓氏变了……（咽了口唾沫。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_04_1007_042miy", "source_sha256": "318fd0aafe73a6603567c1aed6c146dc48c447aa63ae17bec650ef5bdf73300e", "ja": "？\n変わったら……？", "zh": "？变了的话……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_04_1008_044miz", "source_sha256": "576687eae36c6390a4cd3ab015a3ea56b149387e9dac7c9422134030cb664864", "ja": "学校のみんなに、バレます。\nもちろん、劇場のみんなにも……。", "zh": "会被学校的大家发现。\n当然，剧场的大家也是……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_04_1009_029umi", "source_sha256": "8adacb5ba49f4a5633e707dab3a3bdf4d107ec49fda7541c61ad1eef638459d8", "ja": "はっ！？　確かにそうだよね！？\nそ、それはちょっと照れちゃうかも……！", "zh": "哈！？确实是这样没错吧！？\n这、这样一来可能会有点不好意思……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_04_1010_044miz", "source_sha256": "2b43e533695652814909fc1fa160915c6758209b32dbe6e9e400eabfc7ec836f", "ja": "私は、苗字で呼んでいるので。仮に劇場の誰かが\n結婚したら、間違えてしまうことに。……大問題だぞ。", "zh": "因为我一直叫大家的姓氏。要是剧场里的某个人结婚了，我就会叫错。……这可是大问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_04_1011_042miy", "source_sha256": "5cb04b711fa90537c8b59213daabad72d1c3dfb75df0870cbc1753e338b81af5", "ja": "でも、苗字はそのままの人もいますから～。\n男性が、女性の苗字にするとか～。", "zh": "不过，也有人会保留原来的姓氏嘛～。比如男性改成女性的姓氏之类的～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_04_1012_029umi", "source_sha256": "6ad88d21bb7fabeef6ed810b1b423f60ab066b2cc209f50bd13305d0122970af", "ja": "あ、そっか。そこは人それぞれだよね……。\nもしも相手が、私の苗字になるとしたら……。", "zh": "啊，这样啊。确实因人而异呢……\n要是对方随了我的姓……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_04_1013_029umi", "source_sha256": "16b40364fbf330fdcb5e5c5e8ba36c40f2d8e52a20fd2b34af7915e49da13d08", "ja": "高坂プロデューサーって、\n色んな人に呼ばれることになるのかぁ……。", "zh": "以后大家都会叫你高坂制作人了啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_04_1014_042miy", "source_sha256": "6201c22d4786a6f970cf807cec26ec4a059ad332ce903e345add77f3ee51846e", "ja": "私は、宮尾プロデューサー、ですね～。\n仕事場で呼ばれる度に、照れてしまいそうですな～。", "zh": "我就是宫尾制作人呢～。\n每次在工作场合被这么称呼，感觉都会害羞起来呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_04_1015_044miz", "source_sha256": "1f01315753ed7555c6b9c35f4e6a3b09ee85d56f43c3821002b118ad66a604a2", "ja": "真壁プロデューサー＆真壁瑞希……。\n溢れ出る有能コンビ感。……悪くないぞ。", "zh": "真壁制作人＆真壁瑞希……。\n这股满溢而出的能干搭档感……还不错嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_04_1019_029umi", "source_sha256": "4ccca44070d852652dfec3a6b613046681b6f0058e1d0cbe3c8158963c7c07e8", "ja": "あのっ、ほら！　今は{$P$}に\n相手役をやってもらってるから！　ね！？", "zh": "那个，你看！现在正让{$P$}来演对手戏！对吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_04_1020_029umi", "source_sha256": "f09d28337597c1acfa1826615d943feccc45e87bcc6df1287aa8cd198d170286", "ja": "つい、リアルに想像しちゃって……。\nは～、なんか顔熱くなってきちゃった！", "zh": "不小心就想象得太真实了……\n哈～，感觉脸都开始发烫了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_04_1021_044miz", "source_sha256": "43d5be11ecbb107f785d6093e89005f2feba39b31f7e7ac6f3626302bbee53d0", "ja": "苗字は、具体的な変化です。私も、想像が\n一気に膨らんでしまいました。……ドキドキ。", "zh": "姓氏，是非常具体的变化。我也忍不住，一下子想象了好多。……心跳加速。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_04_1022_042miy", "source_sha256": "3ce2c90ebd27f461f08caf66e032550459f8713a9a839123763aa6472567f013", "ja": "この場に{$P$}さんがいなくて、\nよかったですね～。", "zh": "幸好这时候{$P$}先生不在呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_04_1023_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_04_1024_029umi", "source_sha256": "1ad15c61de19e0db5b53ccc861835f62e6ca192f71a7d2e08d46b332d31153ca", "ja": "はっ！？", "zh": "啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_04_1025_044miz", "source_sha256": "be52baa920ea3a3894da99ce9cd3b4766223f0298de3d5fed9b3f2325545a9a3", "ja": "はっ。", "zh": "哈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_04_1026_042miy", "source_sha256": "d2c632e22b91d2cf6a2ada6fd327c3d26cbc0b8746d9db459e9b9f902780d7f3", "ja": "おや～？", "zh": "哎呀～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_04_1027_013hib", "source_sha256": "714b17e3f5121cf3fcd7b152294bdbbc93b93345082eff272c7ab8821ef06760", "ja": "ど、どうしたのみんな？　入ってきた瞬間、\nすごい勢いで振り返ってきたけど……。", "zh": "大、大家怎么了？一进来就气势汹汹地转过身来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_04_1028_042miy", "source_sha256": "6b4d4efba2ff4db8b85ea3226ea36a61068d49b6d76311b2a870e763db21b967", "ja": "おや～。\n響さんと奈緒さんでしたか～。", "zh": "哎呀～  \n原来是响小姐和奈绪小姐呀～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_04_1029_044miz", "source_sha256": "5da6b9bba67a691229323210c793894450a19f450dd5e33749287664b08d60d5", "ja": "気にしないでください。何もありません。\nありませんでしたから。……本当だぞ。", "zh": "请别在意。什么都没有。\n因为真的什么都没有……真的哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_04_1030_037nao", "source_sha256": "03968656553962ffe2cadfd17b7ac613e9da8871f37c252e78b595a315c9a139", "ja": "いや、何かあったとしか思えんけど……。\nあ、みんなでアンケートの続きやってるん？", "zh": "不，怎么看都是发生了什么吧……\n啊，你们是在一起填问卷的后续吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_04_1031_029umi", "source_sha256": "892c000520c267328f2f859cceb510c560389981ad8432165db97ec3a77036d8", "ja": "そうなの！\n私たちは結構進んだけど、ふたりは？", "zh": "就是这样！\n我们已经完成不少了，你们两个呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_04_1032_013hib", "source_sha256": "9c18128c87d82f997fdb3f4e45c512e48908bf152b508614191fe0e0242cd840", "ja": "自分と奈緒は、もうほとんど終わってるぞ！\n次は……99個目の質問かな。", "zh": "我和奈绪已经快做完了！接下来……应该是第99个问题吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_04_1033_042miy", "source_sha256": "e855f86062b7cf8c0c3c52d9ca547cc5862a839e81041105deecaeda6a3d1065", "ja": "お～、順調ですな～。\n私たちよりも進んでいますね～。", "zh": "哦～，进展顺利嘛～。\n比我们还快呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_04_1034_037nao", "source_sha256": "7c61d12b90a18d507b19a7863783881c84b80303e1c3b8a896c5b655cb94bb63", "ja": "あとちょっとで終わるし、\n私らもここでアンケートやってもええ？", "zh": "马上就要搞定了，\n我们也能在这里做问卷调查吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_04_1035_029umi", "source_sha256": "bf070858f92ed20a807ad0adf2d0b9c7eb6e0c778dcb86d8a905915fe39d940b", "ja": "もちろん！\nみんなでラストスパートかけちゃおう☆", "zh": "当然可以！\n大家一起做最后的冲刺吧☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_04_1036_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_04_1037_042miy", "source_sha256": "a68fc8f80512d073128cf91253966a87932db2fdd48a18a4785313ce351a33f1", "ja": "『Q.結婚後、ペットを飼うなら？』\nむ～ん……。やはり、猫でしょうか～。", "zh": "“问：结婚后，如果要养宠物会选什么？”\n嗯～……还是猫咪吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_04_1038_044miz", "source_sha256": "562a4a1991b4b921b83b424acafc204b54ece1d628a852c5cda742e7e4876aab", "ja": "猫ですか。私は、マジックにハトを使うので……\n猫とハトの同居、大丈夫かな。", "zh": "是猫吗？因为我变魔术时会用到鸽子……\n猫和鸽子一起住，真的没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_04_1039_029umi", "source_sha256": "f88e916e143d77a64224c6c26bfda683da043c6a6a79d582911ad604f2e95f04", "ja": "猫のしなやかな筋肉と、立派なハト胸……\n確かに悩ましいかも……！", "zh": "猫那柔韧的肌肉，还有那结实的鸽胸……\n确实有点让人苦恼……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_04_1041_044miz", "source_sha256": "020b630fe0f09f9fcc2da062525205235067226e92837e5040c6cdd2798976bd", "ja": "横山さん、どうかしましたか？\n先ほどから、手が止まってしまっているようですが。", "zh": "横山小姐，您怎么了？\n从刚才开始，您的手好像就停下来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_04_1042_037nao", "source_sha256": "c3ebd848e9daec9fd3a8c78c5de1830a3f47403658bab831d4fea32d955affa9", "ja": "えっ？　あ、いや……！　なんでやろ、\n今日は頭働かへんみたいで……。", "zh": "诶？啊，不是……！怎么回事呢，今天好像脑子不太灵光……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_04_1043_037nao", "source_sha256": "8081f7547861651be16e3bcf12975c9e072ac412d3fae0451eebcdf51215d837", "ja": "ちょっと、続きは家でやる方がええみたいやわ。\n響はどうする？", "zh": "等等，看来还是回家继续比较好。\n响，你打算怎么办？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_04_1044_013hib", "source_sha256": "b760d5e09f5b14fd1f7eb722bcb8245c9052a6288e47ad29cfa0ba5faa206fc5", "ja": "あ……うん。自分もそうする！\nみんな、またね！", "zh": "啊……嗯。我也这么做！\n大家，回头见！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_04_1045_029umi", "source_sha256": "a1fb09e11e83d5a9d1cebfb53dc7511222db6ce6508534840c361e10945625b2", "ja": "う、うん。またねー！", "zh": "嗯、嗯！下次见——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_04_1046_se", "source_sha256": "ec1af790cbe5a717d390a701e0d39fdb8669efd3b376f0195d6a366da2749d27", "ja": "パタン……", "zh": "磅……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_04_1047_044miz", "source_sha256": "b12cf0a99322ea2543dff78898e1180f0f85c835d3ff843e5e0b75d2d23e6696", "ja": "横山さん、ずいぶん悩んでいるようでしたね。\n確か、99個目の質問と言っていましたが……。", "zh": "横山小姐，看起来相当苦恼呢。\n我记得她说这是第99个问题，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_04_1048_042miy", "source_sha256": "7a19174028a3308e2d9f11d5d45c45695cf675ed6d218225458c716f29102648", "ja": "99個目の質問は……『Q.結婚に関する不安、\nなんでも書いてみて！』ですか～。", "zh": "第99个问题是……“Q.关于结婚的不安，\n随便写写看吧！”这样啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
